# Development Workflow

- Work on a branch. Do not commit directly to `main`.
- Use pull requests for all production changes.
- Keep every change schema-first. Update `src/lib/schema.ts` before adding fields to UI or generators.
- Preserve generated artifact filenames, headings, and stable IDs unless the product explicitly changes the bundle contract.
- Run `npm run typecheck` and `npm run build` before marking a change ready.
- Do not expose provider secrets in browser code or `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` variables.
- Use the existing UI primitives in `src/components/ui.tsx` and keep mobile web layouts usable.
- If the change affects architecture artifacts, verify HLD, LLD, schema design, API, security, data, infra, scaling, and observability sections still render.

